adjudication.rationale:
In packages/core/EventManager.ts the diff introduces:

```ts
const [mainHostDestinationCalendar] = evt.destinationCalendar ?? [];
if (evt.location === MeetLocationType && mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration !== "google_calendar") {
  ...
}
```

If `evt.destinationCalendar` is `undefined`/`null` or an empty array, destructuring yields `mainHostDestinationCalendar === undefined`. When `evt.location === MeetLocationType`, the condition dereferences `mainHostDestinationCalendar.integration` without optional chaining, which will throw a `TypeError`. This is directly verifiable from the diff.
